<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Anheuser-Busch cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has cut its rating for Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc to neutral from underperform, a source at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The brewing company's stock closed at 38 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
